# Hotel PMS — Elektraweb live bridge

**Operator / engineer guide:** [doc/ELEKTRAWEB-LIVE-BRIDGE.md](../../doc/ELEKTRAWEB-LIVE-BRIDGE.md)  
**Extension install:** [extensions/elektraweb-bridge/README.md](../../extensions/elektraweb-bridge/README.md)  
**ADR:** [docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-live-bridge.md](../../../docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-live-bridge.md)

## Tenant binding

| Source of truth | Env / token claim |
|-----------------|-------------------|
| ERA org | `ERA_SATELLITE_ORGANIZATION_ID` (deployment; never from Elektraweb) |
| Elektraweb property | `ELEKTRAWEB_HOTEL_ID` (e.g. 31606) |
| Bridge JWT | embeds both; ingest 409 if row `HOTELID` mismatches |

## Auth

- Options login form → `POST /api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/login`
- Ingest Bearer: bridge JWT or optional `ELEKTRAWEB_BRIDGE_TOKEN`
- Kill switch: `ELEKTRAWEB_BRIDGE_ENABLED=1`

## API

| Method | Route |
|--------|-------|
| POST | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/login` |
| POST | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge` |
| GET | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/health` |

Lifecycle on status-diff: `guest-lifecycle-events.ts` (not full native check-in posting).
